  "published": "2026-11-07T10:30:17.813Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v17.0.0 / v18.0.0: Initial release. Ships as two version lines — 17.x for Umbraco 17 and 18.x for Umbraco 18 — with each line's Umbraco dependency boxed to that one major, so an Umbraco 17 host always resolves the 17.x line. TextToSpeechPlayer ViewComponent (text-first: the template passes the text to read), Browser voice by default, OpenAI-compatible speech API provider (SSRF-guarded), disk audio cache keyed by content hash, background generation queue, publish handling, orphan cleanup, and a backoffice workspace (Voices, Rules, Cache) with an Audio content app. Piper and Kokoro offline engines ship as separate add-on packages.",
